      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predicted Court Trajectory and Disposition: *Frank Parasmo v. United States* (No. 26-377)\\n\\n## Current Docket Posture and Further Distributions (`relist-increment`)\\n\\nAs of the October 5, 2026 snapshot, this petition has been distributed once (`distribution_count = 1`, on September 30, 2026, for the October 16, 2026 Conference) following the United States' September 28, 2026 waiver of its right to respond. On October 5, 2026, the Court requested a response from the United States",
